WEBVTT

01:47.840 --> 01:49.840
How did you end up with low blood sugar?

01:56.840 --> 01:57.720
Are you better now?

01:58.320 --> 01:59.520
Much better.

01:59.600 --> 02:00.920
The heart palpitations stopped.

02:02.520 --> 02:04.240
Have some cookies.

02:05.320 --> 02:06.480
I'll order some noodles for you.

02:07.320 --> 02:08.160
Look at you.

02:08.240 --> 02:10.880
Although work is important,
you need to take care of yourself.

02:10.960 --> 02:12.040
It's late at night.

02:12.120 --> 02:13.320
How could you

02:13.400 --> 02:15.680
run around and work overtime
instead of coming back?

02:16.280 --> 02:19.000
Quan Shengtang… He's waiting for us.

02:19.080 --> 02:20.720
Where are you going?

02:22.080 --> 02:23.040
Mr. Tang.

02:23.120 --> 02:25.160
Is Su Chengcheng
the only employee in your company?

02:25.240 --> 02:26.720
Do you have to do this to her?

02:28.640 --> 02:30.680
Put Quan Shengtang's matter aside.

02:30.760 --> 02:32.360
Get some rest.

02:32.440 --> 02:33.320
I'm leaving.

02:34.080 --> 02:35.720
Thank you for bringing me back.

02:35.800 --> 02:36.920
Goodbye.

02:48.240 --> 02:50.000
- He's gone.
- Have you hidden it?

02:50.080 --> 02:52.720
Have I ever let you down?

02:52.800 --> 02:55.640
Ms. Lin, thank you for saving my life.

03:00.520 --> 03:03.080
Tang Qi might be a little blind,

03:03.160 --> 03:04.320
but he's not a fool.

03:04.400 --> 03:07.080
He can only see the color
of you and Quan Shengtang.

03:07.160 --> 03:08.680
I think

03:09.200 --> 03:12.720
his heart has found out everything

03:13.400 --> 03:16.160
and is sending the message to him.

03:18.640 --> 03:20.440
It's not comics.

03:20.520 --> 03:22.120
There's no such thing.

03:24.040 --> 03:27.200
You cured his eyes with only two kisses.

03:27.280 --> 03:30.560
Do you know
who's the last person cured by a kiss?

03:30.640 --> 03:33.000
The Sleeping Beauty.

03:33.920 --> 03:35.760
Your story can compare to that.

03:41.480 --> 03:43.800
I'll quickly put an end to this.

03:43.880 --> 03:45.400
I'll make Quan Shengtang disappear.

04:20.240 --> 04:21.480
Hello, Mr. Tang.

04:21.560 --> 04:22.800
Where are you?

04:22.880 --> 04:24.280
I didn't see you and Su Chengcheng,

04:24.360 --> 04:26.280
so I came back to our room.

04:26.360 --> 04:28.000
Where are you? I'm coming.

04:28.080 --> 04:30.840
No need. I'm heading back.

04:52.120 --> 04:53.600
Why are you packing so early?

04:53.680 --> 04:55.800
I have work tomorrow morning
and have to go back now.

04:57.440 --> 04:59.960
Thank you for taking care of me.

05:00.040 --> 05:01.040
Hope we meet again soon.

05:02.880 --> 05:04.880
Did you have juice?

05:09.000 --> 05:09.840
Orange juice?

05:13.160 --> 05:14.000
Yes.

05:16.240 --> 05:18.240
Su Chengcheng also had orange juice.

05:23.040 --> 05:26.360
It contains vitamins.
It's good for health.

05:29.240 --> 05:31.400
I'm leaving. Bye.

05:44.320 --> 05:45.680
What's wrong with me?

05:46.200 --> 05:49.040
Why do I still feel they're so similar?

05:54.520 --> 05:55.360
You're back.

05:56.760 --> 05:59.000
You have no idea how frightening it was.

05:59.080 --> 06:01.320
He even smelt the orange juice on me.

06:02.160 --> 06:03.320
If I stayed a little longer,

06:03.400 --> 06:04.800
he'd definitely find out.

06:06.880 --> 06:09.240
Tang Qi's eyes are ill,

06:09.320 --> 06:10.800
but his brain is smart.

06:11.480 --> 06:13.120
I'm finally free.

06:13.200 --> 06:14.760
From now on,

06:14.840 --> 06:16.160
Quan Shengtang will disappear,

06:16.240 --> 06:18.320
and I'll live my own life.

06:34.760 --> 06:35.600
What's wrong?

06:37.680 --> 06:38.520
UPGRADING

06:40.680 --> 06:42.160
I'm stuck again.

06:43.680 --> 06:45.160
The filter is upgrading again.

06:46.240 --> 06:48.160
I can't change back into myself,

06:48.920 --> 06:51.120
and I'm still using
Quan Shengtang's voice.

06:51.840 --> 06:53.080
You should leave now.

06:54.320 --> 06:56.440
- But my work…
- No buts.

06:56.520 --> 06:58.040
The fair is over.

06:58.120 --> 07:00.440
Even if there's any work left,
it can't be important.

07:00.520 --> 07:01.680
Someone else can do it.

07:02.560 --> 07:03.600
If they need you,

07:03.680 --> 07:06.640
I'll tell them you were sick
and left with Quan Shengtang.

07:07.360 --> 07:08.640
Sorry for the trouble.

07:08.720 --> 07:10.960
That's what friends do.

07:22.520 --> 07:24.920
Give this to Wang Yi.
She knows how to handle it.

07:33.640 --> 07:35.920
Drive my car.
I'll take your company's car tomorrow.

07:42.200 --> 07:43.200
Goodbye.

07:44.480 --> 07:45.720
Drive safely.

08:13.560 --> 08:15.080
30 MINUTES AGO

08:57.840 --> 08:59.080
Thank you

08:59.600 --> 09:01.280
for giving me a ride.

09:02.080 --> 09:03.920
You stopped my car.

09:04.480 --> 09:05.680
Did I have a choice?

09:07.160 --> 09:08.080
What?

09:09.240 --> 09:10.640
I mean, you're too polite.

09:32.000 --> 09:33.600
LIN YUAN

09:47.040 --> 09:49.720
It's raining over here. What about you?

09:50.960 --> 09:52.320
Not raining yet.

09:56.680 --> 09:59.520
You're driving alone at night,
so I'm a little worried.

09:59.600 --> 10:01.120
- Maybe…
- I'm not alone.

10:01.200 --> 10:02.640
Tang Qi is here.

10:04.560 --> 10:06.560
He's in your car?

10:07.240 --> 10:08.080
Yes.

10:09.160 --> 10:10.120
Don't worry.

10:10.920 --> 10:13.680
We'll figure it out.

10:16.400 --> 10:17.920
Figure it out…

10:18.640 --> 10:19.920
How?

10:37.880 --> 10:39.520
Are you two quite close?

10:40.520 --> 10:42.840
We grew up together.
Of course, we're close.

10:48.440 --> 10:49.360
WANG YI

11:01.560 --> 11:03.080
Why is Wang Yi calling you at this hour?

11:05.000 --> 11:08.280
Maybe she wants
to congratulate me for the show.

11:10.920 --> 11:11.840
WANG YI

11:14.360 --> 11:15.000
WANG YI

11:20.040 --> 11:22.360
Sorry for the trouble.

11:23.240 --> 11:26.280
I'll tell Wang Yi
not to call our clients after work.

11:26.360 --> 11:28.040
It's not her fault.

11:28.120 --> 11:29.000
It's my fault.

11:29.920 --> 11:32.360
We're driving on a rainy night.

11:32.440 --> 11:33.600
It's not safe to answer calls.

11:38.680 --> 11:40.000
WANG YI

11:44.280 --> 11:46.280
Focus on driving. Be careful.

11:46.360 --> 11:47.200
I'll talk to Wang Yi.

11:47.280 --> 11:49.360
WANG YI

11:49.440 --> 11:50.880
I'm Tang Qi.

11:51.400 --> 11:53.680
Wang Yi, it's not working time,

11:53.760 --> 11:55.760
and your calls were declined.

11:55.840 --> 11:58.240
Stop calling like this. It's harassment.

11:58.840 --> 12:00.760
Mr. Tang, why is it you?

12:01.680 --> 12:03.680
Due to the weather,
we need to check the goods now.

12:03.760 --> 12:05.000
Su Chengcheng has the list and receipts.

12:06.680 --> 12:08.520
I'll handle it myself.

12:13.920 --> 12:15.800
It is Su Chengcheng's number.

12:15.880 --> 12:17.840
Why did Mr. Tang answer it?

12:19.480 --> 12:20.640
WANG YI

12:28.640 --> 12:30.840
WANG YI

12:30.920 --> 12:32.720
Hello, Wang Yi. I'm Quan Shengtang.

12:32.800 --> 12:35.120
I'm driving right now
and can't answer your call.

12:35.200 --> 12:36.040
Talk to Lin Yuan.

12:36.120 --> 12:37.560
She'll explain everything.

12:43.320 --> 12:45.040
It's Su Chengcheng's number.

12:45.120 --> 12:47.240
Why did Quan Shengtang answer it?

12:51.480 --> 12:52.800
Su Chengcheng?

12:53.960 --> 12:55.160
Mr. Tang?

12:56.360 --> 12:57.840
Quan Shengtang?

13:00.480 --> 13:01.880
Never mind. I'll call Lin Yuan.

13:08.640 --> 13:11.120
I'm so sorry for the wait.

13:11.680 --> 13:12.600
I should apologize.

13:12.680 --> 13:14.560
It's late and raining,
and I asked you to come.

13:14.640 --> 13:17.200
It's okay. I don't have
anything else to do.

13:17.280 --> 13:19.160
Chengcheng said you knew the passcode.

13:19.240 --> 13:22.760
The list is on her laptop.
And here are all the receipts.

13:22.840 --> 13:23.680
Thanks.

13:24.320 --> 13:27.400
How's Chengcheng? Is she better?
Why did she suddenly feel uncomfortable?

13:27.480 --> 13:29.480
She was just too tired.

13:29.560 --> 13:31.840
Low blood sugar. She needs some rest.

13:31.920 --> 13:34.360
You can get back to work. I'm leaving.

13:34.440 --> 13:35.720
Be careful.

13:35.800 --> 13:37.240
Are you with Quan Shengtang?

13:39.960 --> 13:41.760
Be careful when driving.

13:45.960 --> 13:47.040
Why are your clothes wet?

13:48.760 --> 13:51.760
The rain was too heavy to avoid.
I'll get changed later.

13:59.960 --> 14:02.680
Wang Yi, did you contact Su Chengcheng?

14:03.560 --> 14:05.880
Lin Yuan brought the laptop
and receipts here.

14:05.960 --> 14:08.400
- However, the person who answered my call…
- Gu Yu!

14:15.680 --> 14:18.360
There's thunder and lightning.

14:18.440 --> 14:21.480
I'm a little scared.
Can you take me back to the inn?

14:31.160 --> 14:34.080
Wang Yi, now that you've got
the list and receipts,

14:34.160 --> 14:35.640
hurry up

14:35.720 --> 14:37.680
and finish the checking process.

14:39.280 --> 14:40.600
It won't take long.

14:40.680 --> 14:41.720
Mr. Gu, you can go back.

14:43.200 --> 14:44.480
Come on. I'll walk with you.

14:56.320 --> 14:58.360
They'll remove all these things
tomorrow, right?

14:59.160 --> 15:02.240
Our staff recorded
the layouts of this street.

15:03.080 --> 15:04.880
When they finish the video,
I'll send it to you.

15:05.520 --> 15:06.720
That's great.

15:06.800 --> 15:07.640
Thank you.

15:10.480 --> 15:12.800
If you want to thank me, why don't you

15:13.360 --> 15:14.560
answer me a question?

15:16.560 --> 15:17.600
What question?

15:24.840 --> 15:26.960
What secret are you, Su Chengcheng,

15:27.040 --> 15:28.360
and Quan Shengtang hiding?

15:33.080 --> 15:35.440
If I tell you,

15:36.080 --> 15:37.480
it won't be a secret.

15:39.760 --> 15:40.720
That's right.

15:42.360 --> 15:43.720
Why don't you keep asking?

15:43.800 --> 15:45.520
Do you want me to?

15:46.960 --> 15:48.120
Then I'll stop.

15:49.640 --> 15:52.600
Aren't you afraid we might
do something bad against you?

15:52.680 --> 15:54.000
Would you?

15:55.360 --> 15:58.000
Humans are complicated.
I can be bad, okay?

16:00.080 --> 16:02.400
Do I look completely innocent?

16:02.480 --> 16:04.120
You do look like a bad person.

16:04.200 --> 16:05.560
I'm so scared.

16:06.080 --> 16:07.000
Liar.

16:12.480 --> 16:14.640
It's safer to take turns driving.

16:15.360 --> 16:17.360
Well, tell me if you get tired.

16:18.560 --> 16:20.240
Okay, you can get some rest.

16:31.040 --> 16:32.200
What's wrong?

16:32.280 --> 16:33.360
Nothing.

16:33.440 --> 16:35.400
I dropped something. I'm looking for it.

16:41.040 --> 16:42.400
The rain is easing up.

16:44.200 --> 16:45.480
Haven't you found it?

16:45.560 --> 16:47.680
Do you want me to stop
and turn up the light?

16:47.760 --> 16:48.680
No need!

16:49.360 --> 16:50.200
No need.

16:51.000 --> 16:51.920
Found it.

17:26.040 --> 17:27.119
Your face…

17:28.000 --> 17:29.000
Your face…

17:34.720 --> 17:35.800
Quan Shengtang…

17:38.040 --> 17:39.880
Your face turned into Su Chengcheng.

17:46.640 --> 17:47.960
Tang Qi…

17:48.760 --> 17:50.560
Gu Yu…

17:52.280 --> 17:53.440
Monster!

17:53.520 --> 17:54.720
Go away!

17:54.800 --> 17:56.280
- You're not human!
- What happened?

17:56.360 --> 17:59.080
- Stay away from me! Don't touch me!
- Quan Shengtang.

17:59.160 --> 18:00.560
Quan Shengtang, what's going on?

18:00.640 --> 18:02.160
I saw…

18:02.680 --> 18:05.200
I saw your face turn into Gu Yu.

18:05.280 --> 18:07.160
What are you?

18:18.680 --> 18:19.960
It changed again!

18:20.040 --> 18:20.880
Your face…

18:20.960 --> 18:23.120
Are you Tang Qi or Gu Yu?

18:29.560 --> 18:30.440
My face changed?

18:33.360 --> 18:34.360
I saw

18:34.880 --> 18:36.520
your face become Gu Yu.

18:36.600 --> 18:38.560
I saw your face turn into Su Chengcheng!

18:40.600 --> 18:41.720
Are you serious?

18:45.040 --> 18:46.280
My face…

18:47.880 --> 18:48.960
Did it change too?

18:53.000 --> 18:54.600
I became Su Chengcheng?

18:55.120 --> 18:56.040
How's that possible?

18:56.680 --> 18:59.120
I saw your face became Su Chengcheng
when it thundered.

18:59.200 --> 19:02.160
Your face also turned into Gu Yu
when it thundered.

19:04.520 --> 19:07.200
I became Su Chengcheng,
and you became Gu Yu.

19:08.880 --> 19:11.320
Why did we see different faces
at the same time?

19:19.360 --> 19:21.480
It seems he believed it.

19:37.760 --> 19:39.600
I'm sure I'm still me.

19:40.880 --> 19:42.320
What you saw…

19:43.840 --> 19:44.680
Yes.

19:45.400 --> 19:46.680
It must be an illusion.

19:47.840 --> 19:49.520
And I saw an illusion too.

19:51.280 --> 19:52.960
It's not supernatural.

19:54.360 --> 19:55.840
Do you have an eye disease?

19:57.840 --> 19:58.920
No.

20:03.120 --> 20:04.240
But…

20:04.760 --> 20:07.000
My aunt is a tetrachromat.

20:09.680 --> 20:11.400
I heard she'd see things

20:11.480 --> 20:13.360
when shocked.

20:16.320 --> 20:17.160
You…

20:17.240 --> 20:18.560
Do you have an eye disease?

20:26.200 --> 20:27.800
It seems we both saw illusions.

20:32.280 --> 20:33.920
I suggest you

20:34.600 --> 20:36.440
see an ophthalmologist and do

20:37.760 --> 20:39.120
a thorough examination.

20:39.200 --> 20:40.040
Okay.

20:42.560 --> 20:44.440
I'm still young.

20:45.480 --> 20:47.320
I can't believe I'm seeing things.

20:52.880 --> 20:54.040
Don't be nervous.

20:54.640 --> 20:57.080
Sometimes, illusions
are caused by mental problems.

20:57.600 --> 21:00.200
Listen to the doctor, and you'll be fine.

21:04.840 --> 21:05.920
You too. Don't be nervous.

21:10.600 --> 21:11.440
Sorry.

21:15.800 --> 21:17.560
If I hadn't insisted on driving at night,

21:18.080 --> 21:19.440
you wouldn't have seen illusions.

21:21.440 --> 21:22.440
It's not your fault.

21:22.960 --> 21:24.080
My eyes…

21:27.880 --> 21:29.120
Someone can cure my eyes.

21:30.000 --> 21:31.040
Who?

21:32.040 --> 21:32.880
Su Chengcheng.

21:38.560 --> 21:39.920
I don't know why,

21:41.160 --> 21:42.480
but every time I see you,

21:43.360 --> 21:44.720
I think of Su Chengcheng.

21:47.440 --> 21:48.400
I even…

21:50.480 --> 21:52.560
I even think you're the same person.

21:54.600 --> 21:56.200
I insisted on taking your car

21:57.320 --> 22:00.360
because I wanted to know
why I'm having such a strange feeling.

22:03.560 --> 22:05.520
Maybe God thinks I'm stupid,

22:06.040 --> 22:08.760
so he let me see you become her.

22:16.160 --> 22:17.440
We're both doctors.

22:17.520 --> 22:20.840
We should believe in science
instead of ghost stories.

22:24.920 --> 22:25.920
The rain is about to stop.

22:26.000 --> 22:27.080
Let's hurry up and go back.

22:28.080 --> 22:29.560
We're both seeing things.

22:29.640 --> 22:30.800
We can't drive.

22:31.920 --> 22:33.240
Let's ask someone else to drive.

22:33.320 --> 22:36.680
That's right. You're so thoughtful.

23:00.160 --> 23:01.080
Where's Su Chengcheng?

23:02.520 --> 23:03.560
She's taking a day off.

23:36.680 --> 23:38.080
Your eyes are healthy.

23:38.160 --> 23:40.080
No pathological causes for hallucinations.

23:40.160 --> 23:41.240
Are you sure

23:41.760 --> 23:43.440
you saw things?

23:53.560 --> 23:54.640
Here's the dual SIM phone.

24:04.040 --> 24:05.640
CALLING…

24:07.000 --> 24:07.840
CALL

24:09.560 --> 24:12.480
CALL

24:23.360 --> 24:26.280
CALL

24:33.280 --> 24:34.520
I knew it.

24:35.920 --> 24:36.760
What are you talking about?

24:40.120 --> 24:41.520
WANG YI

24:45.000 --> 24:47.920
WANG YI

24:49.280 --> 24:51.880
Quan Shengtang's phone has two SIM cards.

24:53.160 --> 24:54.080
So what?

24:54.600 --> 24:56.600
Everyone has their secrets.

24:57.480 --> 24:59.440
Who does the other number belong to?

25:03.080 --> 25:04.400
Do you mean…

25:11.360 --> 25:12.760
Mr. Tang, what's wrong?

25:12.840 --> 25:14.960
I answered your call last night.

25:15.800 --> 25:16.840
Who were you calling?

25:24.880 --> 25:26.320
Be honest.

25:26.400 --> 25:28.080
I won't blame anyone.

25:30.080 --> 25:31.440
I called Su Chengcheng.

25:31.520 --> 25:35.280
She said she lent her phone
to Quan Shengtang

25:35.360 --> 25:37.080
and was afraid of being blamed,

25:37.600 --> 25:38.640
so she told me not to tell you.

25:43.240 --> 25:44.280
Did

25:44.800 --> 25:46.520
Su Chengcheng tell you this in person?

25:47.720 --> 25:49.800
She sent WeChat messages.

25:54.280 --> 25:55.960
So, it means

25:56.040 --> 25:58.120
you haven't seen

25:58.760 --> 26:00.440
Su Chengcheng in person
since last night, right?

26:02.520 --> 26:03.360
Yes.

26:04.000 --> 26:05.760
You called Su Chengcheng.

26:06.280 --> 26:07.560
I answered it once.

26:08.720 --> 26:10.000
Then Quan Shengtang answered it.

26:13.240 --> 26:14.080
Yes.

26:17.640 --> 26:19.880
Nothing else. Get back to work.

26:27.240 --> 26:30.320
They're using the same phone?

26:30.920 --> 26:32.120
How's that possible?

26:32.640 --> 26:35.040
Didn't you see them
appear at the same time?

26:35.680 --> 26:36.520
Mr. Tang!

26:37.960 --> 26:40.080
Wait a minute. I just finished dinner.

26:40.160 --> 26:41.480
I'm coming.

26:48.080 --> 26:50.840
Quan Shengtang and Su Chengcheng
didn't show up together.

26:52.760 --> 26:54.800
They only seemed to be there
at the same time.

26:56.720 --> 26:58.720
Su Chengcheng beside me was real.

27:00.480 --> 27:02.240
Then Quan Shengtang in the room

27:05.360 --> 27:06.560
was very likely to be fake.

27:07.240 --> 27:10.480
But you saw him in person.
How could it be fake?

27:17.120 --> 27:18.760
That figure of you is fake.

27:26.240 --> 27:28.200
I must've got up

27:28.280 --> 27:29.720
in the wrong way

27:30.240 --> 27:32.840
and turned the suspense mode on.

27:39.800 --> 27:41.680
I only need to confirm one last thing.

27:47.160 --> 27:49.960
Then I'll know
if it was really an illusion.

28:06.280 --> 28:08.400
What's wrong with Chengcheng's work?

28:09.640 --> 28:12.400
She's been working overtime
since last weekend.

28:12.920 --> 28:14.840
I haven't seen her for days.

28:17.840 --> 28:18.680
Who is it?

28:24.480 --> 28:25.680
Mrs. Su, hello. I'm here for…

28:25.760 --> 28:28.000
Qingli, come here.

28:28.520 --> 28:30.640
- Mrs. Su, I'm here for Su…
- Tang Qi?

28:31.160 --> 28:32.000
Why are you here?

28:32.080 --> 28:33.840
Be polite.

28:33.920 --> 28:35.560
There's nothing wrong with pursuing you.

28:35.640 --> 28:37.480
Be polite when rejecting him.

28:37.560 --> 28:38.440
- Mrs. Su.
- Mom.

28:38.520 --> 28:40.240
I'm Tang Qi, Su Chengcheng's colleague.

28:40.320 --> 28:41.920
I'm here for Su Chengcheng.

28:43.600 --> 28:44.760
For Chengcheng?

28:44.840 --> 28:47.440
Why didn't you tell me? Come in, come in.

28:47.520 --> 28:48.360
For Chengcheng?

28:48.440 --> 28:49.760
- Yes.
- Come in, please.

28:49.840 --> 28:51.720
- No need to change your shoes.
- Come in.

28:51.800 --> 28:53.760
- You don't have to bring this.
- Exactly.

28:53.840 --> 28:55.760
It's for Su Chengcheng. Isn't she…?

28:55.840 --> 28:56.680
Tang Qi!

28:58.840 --> 29:00.040
What's wrong with her?

29:01.200 --> 29:03.360
What's wrong with her body?

29:06.520 --> 29:08.280
She's very healthy,

29:08.360 --> 29:10.080
but she's been too tired.

29:10.160 --> 29:12.880
I came here to visit her
on behalf of my company.

29:12.960 --> 29:14.240
You're too kind.

29:14.320 --> 29:16.400
It's her duty to complete her work.

29:16.480 --> 29:17.800
Working overtime doesn't matter.

29:17.880 --> 29:19.080
I'm not bragging,

29:19.160 --> 29:20.920
but Chengcheng has practiced
Yongchun with me

29:21.000 --> 29:22.400
and is very healthy.

29:22.480 --> 29:23.960
She hasn't been ill since she grew up.

29:24.040 --> 29:26.840
- No sick leaves.
- That's right.

29:26.920 --> 29:27.800
- Come in.
- Come in.

29:27.880 --> 29:29.720
Dad, Mom, enjoy the meal.

29:29.800 --> 29:31.920
We'll go to a restaurant
and talk about something.

29:32.000 --> 29:33.600
The dinner is ready.

29:33.680 --> 29:34.880
- Exactly.
- We're not eating.

29:34.960 --> 29:36.480
Bye. Let's go.

29:36.560 --> 29:37.960
Goodbye, Mr. Su, Mrs. Su.

29:38.040 --> 29:39.280
Are you really leaving?

29:39.360 --> 29:40.640
- Be careful.
- Enjoy the meal. Bye.

29:40.720 --> 29:42.320
Come more often.

29:52.320 --> 29:53.520
We've had dinner.

29:53.600 --> 29:55.360
Please don't stall for time.

29:56.120 --> 29:57.440
Where is Su Chengcheng?

29:59.440 --> 30:00.640
Dear old classmate,

30:01.160 --> 30:03.400
I treated you to dinner.

30:03.480 --> 30:05.080
Why do you think I'm stalling for time?

30:05.160 --> 30:06.760
She took a day off,

30:06.840 --> 30:08.960
but your parents thought she was working.

30:10.920 --> 30:14.000
She's your employee, not your girlfriend.

30:14.520 --> 30:16.000
Her whereabouts

30:16.080 --> 30:17.120
are not your business.

30:20.000 --> 30:22.440
I saw Quan Shengtang's face

30:23.160 --> 30:24.440
become Su Chengcheng.

30:29.560 --> 30:32.880
I heard you often went to the hospital
for an eye disease.

30:33.680 --> 30:36.280
It's normal for you
to have hallucinations.

30:41.720 --> 30:43.640
If you don't want to tell me,

30:44.560 --> 30:46.320
I'll go back and ask your parents.

30:47.560 --> 30:48.640
Where's Su Chengcheng?

30:49.320 --> 30:50.240
Tang Qi!

30:55.280 --> 30:57.200
Where is Su Chengcheng?

30:58.240 --> 30:59.920
What's going on with her
and Quan Shengtang?

31:14.080 --> 31:15.160
Tang Qi!

31:24.520 --> 31:26.240
I've had enough of your nonsense.

31:33.760 --> 31:34.720
You want to see me?

31:35.320 --> 31:36.440
More precisely,

31:36.960 --> 31:38.160
I want to see you

31:38.880 --> 31:39.840
and Quan Shengtang.

31:43.840 --> 31:44.680
Oh,

31:44.760 --> 31:46.600
I also asked Quan Shengtang over.

31:47.680 --> 31:48.680
Really?

31:49.400 --> 31:50.560
Mr. Tang…

32:15.520 --> 32:16.520
Mr. Tang…

32:37.160 --> 32:39.560
I'm Su Chengcheng. I'm real.

32:52.240 --> 32:53.840
Quan Shengtang?

32:55.080 --> 32:56.480
I'm Quan Shengtang.

32:57.000 --> 32:58.400
I'm also real.

33:00.360 --> 33:01.280
Did you see that?

33:01.360 --> 33:03.000
Stop being so suspicious.

33:09.840 --> 33:10.760
Sorry.

33:12.000 --> 33:13.160
I was overthinking it.

33:14.240 --> 33:15.840
It's not his fault.

33:15.920 --> 33:17.480
I was acting strange

33:17.560 --> 33:19.280
and caused a misunderstanding.

33:21.400 --> 33:23.840
Quan Shengtang has been
waiting for the result

33:23.920 --> 33:25.480
of a research fund he applied for.

33:27.040 --> 33:31.080
It can change my career and life.

33:31.160 --> 33:32.040
I've been nervous.

33:32.800 --> 33:35.600
And I've been having a fever.

33:37.720 --> 33:40.720
So, I only want to stay in bed.

33:45.360 --> 33:48.000
Hope you can get your research fund.

33:58.560 --> 33:59.640
I'm rich…

34:02.920 --> 34:03.960
I'm rich!

34:05.800 --> 34:06.960
So much money!

34:12.480 --> 34:13.480
- So much!
- Congratulations.

34:22.000 --> 34:22.840
Quan Shengtang?

34:29.400 --> 34:31.480
Quan Shengtang! Quan Shengtang!

34:32.320 --> 34:34.360
Quan Shengtang! What's wrong?

34:34.440 --> 34:35.520
Are you okay?

34:36.040 --> 34:36.880
Are you okay?

34:42.840 --> 34:43.960
Hello.

34:44.760 --> 34:46.400
Someone is coughing up blood!

34:52.000 --> 34:53.600
Be careful, please!

34:54.120 --> 34:55.040
Be careful.

34:55.120 --> 34:56.320
Slow down.

35:02.920 --> 35:04.160
Only one companion.

35:04.240 --> 35:06.360
Just go back. I'll keep you informed.

35:28.720 --> 35:29.800
Mr. Tang…

35:31.360 --> 35:33.120
Quan Shengtang passed away.

35:48.080 --> 35:51.520
GOOD FORTUNE

35:51.600 --> 35:53.080
How's Quan Shengtang?

35:57.120 --> 35:58.480
They couldn't save him.

35:59.480 --> 36:00.360
He died.

36:05.040 --> 36:06.240
Did he

36:06.880 --> 36:09.320
die of overstimulation like Sima Zhao

36:09.400 --> 36:11.120
in Romance of the Three Kingdoms?

36:13.960 --> 36:16.120
Takotsubo cardiomyopathy.

36:17.680 --> 36:19.720
When people are overexcited,

36:21.080 --> 36:22.960
the sympathetic nerves
become overactivated,

36:24.800 --> 36:27.040
leading to excessive catecholamines

36:28.000 --> 36:30.120
and thus coronary artery spasms.

36:31.720 --> 36:33.080
Some myocardial tissues
will become thinner

36:34.720 --> 36:36.400
and bulge like a ball

36:36.480 --> 36:38.520
when impacted by blood.

36:40.120 --> 36:42.320
It's also called Takotsubo syndrome.

36:45.760 --> 36:47.560
I can't believe it.

36:48.760 --> 36:51.880
Quan Shengtang was so young.

36:53.600 --> 36:56.640
If I believed I saw illusions

36:58.600 --> 37:01.520
and didn't confront Su Chengcheng,

37:04.480 --> 37:06.800
Quan Shengtang wouldn't have come out

37:07.960 --> 37:09.720
when having a fever.

37:11.560 --> 37:12.680
And perhaps…

37:14.560 --> 37:16.800
he wouldn't have died.

37:20.160 --> 37:21.520
It was an accident.

37:21.600 --> 37:23.160
It's not your fault.

37:37.320 --> 37:39.440
Zhou and you also know Quan Shengtang.

37:41.960 --> 37:44.080
Why are you not being suspicious?

37:47.600 --> 37:49.080
Why is it just me?

37:50.680 --> 37:52.680
It's not that I didn't find it strange.

37:52.760 --> 37:56.600
However, we're all adults,
and he didn't break the law.

37:56.680 --> 37:58.320
What's the point of digging into it?

38:00.480 --> 38:01.560
Yes.

38:05.080 --> 38:06.880
I wouldn't move on

38:09.480 --> 38:11.240
but insisted on figuring it out.

38:13.440 --> 38:15.320
I forced Quan Shengtang to come out.

38:24.680 --> 38:25.680
Tang,

38:26.200 --> 38:27.240
stop blaming yourself.

38:29.400 --> 38:31.480
I understand
why you want to figure it out.

38:33.680 --> 38:35.760
Su Miao was killed by thunder.

38:38.920 --> 38:41.320
Fang Jin's other personality perished.

38:44.960 --> 38:46.600
It was all because of my fantasy.

38:49.800 --> 38:51.480
If Quan Shengtang

38:53.120 --> 38:55.120
and Su Chengcheng were the same person,

38:58.760 --> 39:00.120
then Su Miao

39:01.240 --> 39:02.760
and Fang Jin…

39:05.680 --> 39:06.880
They wouldn't have…

39:14.640 --> 39:16.680
Quan Shengtang died because

39:19.880 --> 39:21.440
of my crazy fantasy.

39:34.680 --> 39:37.080
I should've seen a psychiatrist.

39:56.120 --> 39:56.960
Tang,

39:57.480 --> 39:59.080
change your clothes first.

39:59.160 --> 40:00.560
There's a blood stain.
